roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2390706946,"text":"おう。一人でお酒を飲むのは寂しいしな。オイラたちと話せば、気分も明るくなるはずだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[705030211]},{"nodeId":705030211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":1837682010,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[705030212]},{"nodeId":705030212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":2092722522,"text":"確かに、一人でお酒を飲んでいたわ。","nextNodeIds":[705030213]},{"nodeId":705030213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":1879208218,"text":"モンドにいると、どの酒場に行っても歓迎されないのよ。今日はせっかく気分が良くて…だから、お酒を飲もうと思ったのに、また人に後ろ指をさされて…","nextNodeIds":[705030214]},{"nodeId":705030214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":3086812306,"text":"君は、どうやってそんなにたくさんの友人を作ったの？","nextNodeIds":[705030215]},{"nodeId":705030215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":1159541330,"text":"人が君のことを話す時、その言葉にはいつも憧れが見えて、みんな微笑んでいるわ。","nextNodeIds":[705030216]},{"nodeId":705030216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":3820780866,"text":"なのに、私の名前を聞いただけで、みんな…","nextNodeIds":[705030217]},{"nodeId":705030217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1254022810,"text":"そんな悪い風に考えないで。","nextNodeIds":[705030218]},{"nodeId":705030218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1812313594,"text":"ローレンス家に生まれたのは、エウルアの意志とは関係ないだろ。それに、オイラたちはそんなこと気にしてないぞ。オイラたちの知ってるエウルアは、すっごくいいやつだからな！","nextNodeIds":[705030219]},{"nodeId":705030219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":803050634,"text":"ただ、エウルアって素直じゃないっていうか…いつも人を恨んでるふりをして、優しい一面を隠すんだよな…","nextNodeIds":[705030220]},{"nodeId":705030220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":3193886026,"text":"ちょっと、誰がふりをしているですって…","nextNodeIds":[705030221,705030222]},{"nodeId":705030221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1820367298,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}たち以外にも…","nextNodeIds":[705030223]},{"nodeId":705030222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1666847650,"text":"みんながエウルアを認める日が来る…","nextNodeIds":[705030223]},{"nodeId":705030223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":1544185834,"text":"本当かしら？酔っ払っていても、そんな日が来るなんて想像できないわ…","nextNodeIds":[705030224]},{"nodeId":705030224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":1564749370,"text":"ずっとずっと…私が西風騎士団に入ってからも、みんなは…","nextNodeIds":[705030225]},{"nodeId":705030225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":587334058,"text":"「風向きは変わるもの。」","nextNodeIds":[705030226]},{"nodeId":705030226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":212991226,"text":"ああ！あの吟遊野郎も、そんなこと言ってたよな。","nextNodeIds":[705030227]},{"nodeId":705030227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2349835986,"text":"エウルア、おまえは自分のやり方で進めばいいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[705030228]},{"nodeId":705030228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1041182842,"text":"いつか、みんなが抱いているローレンス家のイメージを、おまえが変えてやろうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[705030229]},{"nodeId":705030229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4035747146,"text":"辛抱強くね。","nextNodeIds":[705030230]},{"nodeId":705030230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":4038937698,"text":"ええ、ありがとう…","nextNodeIds":[705030231]},{"nodeId":705030231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1029,"speakerName":"エウルア","textMapHash":2222342362,"text":"わ、私…こほんっ！話はここまでにしましょう、今日は帰るわ。","nextNodeIds":[705030232]},{"nodeId":705030232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1062157442,"text":"送ろうか？","nextNodeIds":[705030233]},{"nodeId"